ntional  slight by putting on a cheetah skin  costume  and framing wonder woman for robbery  then trying to kill her  despite her relatively low power level  cheetah remained a thorn in wonder  woman's side throughout the 1940s  during one story she betrays her own  country by passing on military secrets  to the japanese during world war  ii in another priscilla infiltrates  paradise island  and steals queen hippolyta's magical  girdle of power enabling her to finally  go toe-to-toe with wonder woman herself  obviously she still loses which really  can't be good for the old self-esteem  one element of the cheetah character  that's been there since the very  beginning  is the notion of the feline persona as a  separate personality  cheetah's human alter ego whoever that  may be often struggles against and gives  in to the feral persona in their head  before priscilla rich starts wearing her  rug  a fully outfitted cheetah appears in a  vanity mirror encouraging the heiress to  give in to her hatred of wonder woman  and become the quote treacherous  relentless huntress  she already is on the inside decades  later debbie domain stepped into the  cheetah's furry shoes  debbie is a genuinely nice person and a  good friend to wonder woman  until she's brainwashed by the  international supervillain cobra  who transforms her into a vicious  huntress in her own right  for barbara and minerva the divide is  more mystical with the animal instinct  of the cheetah leading her down a path  of animalistic viciousness  that part of her finds repellent no  matter how much she might struggle  however  the cheetah within her always yearns to  be free  given her semi-feral nature it might  come as some surprise to find that  cheetah is actually something of a  joiner  priscilla rich for example is a founding  member of villainy incorporated  an all-female team formed to take  revenge on wonder woman  debuting in wonder woman volume 1 number  28 the team made several appearances  over t